            {
                "description": "On May 6, 1969, at 10:05:00, while traveling on a train back to San Gregorio Armeno, Elena Greco noticed that she was thinking about sex constantly. Elena Greco describes these as 'dirty, tempting' sexual thoughts that she perceived everywhere around her, in other people's actions, in spoken words, and in books. This pervasive focus on sexual content suggests an intrusive, possibly conflicted preoccupation with sex during this specific train journey.",
