            {
                "description": "On June 15, 1971 at 23:10:00 in Vomero, Elena Greco stated that during sexual intercourse she sometimes allows a male partner to approach her from behind. Elena Greco explains that she chooses this sexual position because she feels that in this way the physical pain she experiences during intercourse is a little less. This indicates that Elena Greco is experiencing pain during sex and is actively adjusting sexual positions in order to reduce that pain.",
