            {
                "description": "On 1963-08-08 at 13:30:00, while at the beach, Elena Greco noticed her temples pulsing and kicked the sand with her heels a couple of times. During this moment, Elena Greco consciously recalled the word \"fuck,\" a word she had first heard as a child and that now echoed insistently in her mind. This recollection of the childhood word caused Elena Greco to imagine various scenarios and sexual fantasies, intertwining her past exposure to the word with her current sexual curiosity and arousal at the beach.",
